quran[8]{c,v,t}:
  40,59,"Surely, the Last Hour is bound to come. There is no doubt in that. Yet most people do not believe."
  40,60,"And your Lord has said: ‘Always pray to Me; I shall certainly grant your prayer. Surely, those who turn away from My worship in defiance will soon enter Hell disgraced.’"
  40,61,"Allah is the One Who has made the night for you to repose in and brightened the day to see; surely, Allah is Bountiful to mankind but most people do not give thanks."
  40,62,"That is Allah, your Lord, Who is the Creator of everything. There is no God apart from Him. So where are you wandering disorientated?"
  40,63,"Likewise, those who used to deny the Revelations of Allah were wandering distracted."
  40,64,"Allah is the One Who made the earth a dwelling place for you and the heaven a ceiling and gave you form and features and then perfected your shapes and granted you sustenance of pure things. Such is Allah, your Lord. So Blessed is Allah, the Lord of all the worlds."
  40,65,"He is the Ever-Living. There is no God but He. So worship Him, making obedience and devotion sincerely His. All praise belongs to Allah alone, the Lord of all the worlds."
  40,66,"Say: ‘I have been forbidden to worship those idols that you worship apart from Allah, whereas manifest signs have come to me from my Lord, and I have been commanded to obey the Lord of all the worlds.’"
